OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for murder of woman
OL,4,Amissing for 28 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for life for
OL,7,Fmurdering a woman who went missing 28
OL,8,Fyears ago - after he suddenly confessed
OL,9,Fto police that he had disposed of her
OL,10,Fdecomposed body months after killing
OL,11,Fher.
OL,13,FPatricia Lashley, 33, was last seen
OL,14,Fnear her home on Hall Street, Dudley,
OL,15,Fin September 1998.
OL,17,FTrevor Dunkley, 66, pleaded guilty to
OL,18,Fher murder and preventing her lawful
OL,19,Fburial at Wolverhampton Crown Court in
OL,20,FSeptember. At the same court on Friday,
OL,21,Fhe was handed a life sentence with a
OL,22,Fminimum term of 10 years and 10 months.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
